<meta property="og:title" content="Corso Ercole I d&#039;Este">
<meta property="og:description" content="Corso Ercole I d&#039;Este has repeatedly been cited as one of the most beautiful historic avenues in Europe, and it is certainly one of the most photographed places in Ferrara.
With its palaces and fascinating views it will know how to leave you speechless, and you will find that you will not know where to turn your gaze so as not to miss any detail.
A long street that connects the Estense Castle to the City Walls, more precisely to the Porta degli Angeli, crossing one of the city&#039;s most famous crossroads, the Quadrivio degli Angeli.">
